  "[table 2] Code | Biological traits | No | Categories\nA | Maximal size | 1 | ≤0.25 cm\n2 | >0.25–0.5 cm\n3 | >0.5–1 cm\n4 | >1 cm\nB | Life cycle duration | 1 | ≤1 year\n2 | >1 year\nC | Potential number of reproduction cycles per year | 1 | ≤1\n2 | >1\nD | Aquatic stages | 1 | Egg",
